{"_note":"App Store topfree 榜前 6(xWidget/flow 与 page/flow 同名文件逐字节相同)。本文件由 tools/infosource/gen_appwatch.py 生成,改生成器别改这里(设计 doc/appstore-infosources-v2.md §8)。","i18n":{"zh-CN":{"errChart":"暂时取不到榜单"},"en-US":{"errChart":"Chart unavailable"}},"version":1,"actions":[{"op":"set","props":{"key":"cnd","value":"$[if::(eq::(${@app.region},cn),1,if::(eq::(${@app.region},overseas),0,if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),1,0)))]"},"_note":"国内默认判据(doc/overseas-first.md §1):大陆渠道,或地区未知且界面中文。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"cc","value":"$[if::(eq::(${cnd},1),cn,us)]"},"_note":"国内默认看中国区榜单,其余看美区(海外中文用户也是美区,不再只看语言)。⚠️ 必须排在 request 前(URL 里的 ${cc} 取数那一刻求值)。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"kind","value":"topfree"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"gIn","value":"${genre}"},"_note":"入参先落地(方法参数看不见 flow 入参,§9.5 #3)。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"pg","value":"${page}"}},{"id":"gSaved","action":"data.get","params":{"key":"chartGenre","default":""}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"g","value":"$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${pg},0),1),${gSaved},${gIn})]"},"_note":"分类 id;空 = 全部(URL 的 `genre=` 留空,实测照常返回总榜)。"},{"action":"request","id":"r","params":{"url":"https://itunes.apple.com/${cc}/rss/${kind}applications/limit=10/genre=${g}/json","method":"GET","formatType":"json"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_b","value":"1"},"_note":"⚠️ 请求/并发屏障(勿删):request 与 concurrent 之后**紧邻**的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并,memory [[actionflow-concurrent-late-merge]])。删掉它 → 下面所有 index:: 静默取空 → 卡渲一片 `--`,而流仍报 success。"},{"op":"if","props":{"val":"$[if::(gt::(length::(${r.feed.entry}),0),0,1)]"},"items":[{"action":"error","params":{"errorMsg":"${@i18n.errChart}"}}],"_note":"取数失败 → 抛错终止流,平台据此回落上次成功数据(G26/§7.2)"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"at","value":"$[formatDate::(${@time.nowMs},HH:mm)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"nm0","value":"${r.feed.entry[0].im:name.label}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"dv0","value":"${r.feed.entry[0].im:artist.label}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"ic0","value":"${r.feed.entry[0].im:image[2].label}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"id0","value":"${r.feed.entry[0].id.attributes.im:id}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"nm1","value":"${r.feed.entry[1].im:name.label}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"dv1","value":"${r.feed.entry[1].im:artist.label}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"ic1","value":"${r.feed.entry[1].im:image[2].label}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"id1","value":"${r.feed.entry[1].id.attributes.im:id}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"nm2","value":"${r.feed.entry[2].im:name.label}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"dv2","value":"${r.feed.entry[2].im:artist.label}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"ic2","value":"${r.feed.entry[2].im:image[2].label}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"id2","value":"${r.feed.entry[2].id.attributes.im:id}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"nm3","value":"${r.feed.entry[3].im:name.label}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"dv3","value":"${r.feed.entry[3].im:artist.label}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"ic3","value":"${r.feed.entry[3].im:image[2].label}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"id3","value":"${r.feed.entry[3].id.attributes.im:id}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"nm4","value":"${r.feed.entry[4].im:name.label}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"dv4","value":"${r.feed.entry[4].im:artist.label}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"ic4","value":"${r.feed.entry[4].im:image[2].label}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"id4","value":"${r.feed.entry[4].id.attributes.im:id}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"nm5","value":"${r.feed.entry[5].im:name.label}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"dv5","value":"${r.feed.entry[5].im:artist.label}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"ic5","value":"${r.feed.entry[5].im:image[2].label}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"id5","value":"${r.feed.entry[5].id.attributes.im:id}"}},{"action":"resultFilter","params":{"keys":["cc","g","at","nm0","dv0","ic0","id0","nm1","dv1","ic1","id1","nm2","dv2","ic2","id2","nm3","dv3","ic3","id3","nm4","dv4","ic4","id4","nm5","dv5","ic5","id5"]}}]}
